{"id": 1000003, "slug": "sigame", "name": "SIGame", "name_original": "SIGame", "description": "<p><strong>SIGame</strong> is a classical intellectual game (first released in 2002) that lets you test your knowledge in a competitive atmosphere. In this game, you can challenge both experienced players and smart bots, showcasing your expertise across various fields.</p><h3>Key Features:</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Diverse Thematic Packs:</strong> Play quizzes on general knowledge, books, movies, cartoons and anime, music, and video games.</p></li><li><p><strong>Create Your Own Questions:</strong> Become a game creator by designing your own question packs. Invite friends to play in your unique setting and prove how well you know your own questions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Multiplayer Mode:</strong> Play with friends, compete in PvP mode, and find out who among you is the true master of intellectual games.</p></li></ul><p><strong>SIGame</strong> offers engaging gameplay, a wide range of topics, and various game modes. Immerse yourself in the world of knowledge, test your intellect, and enjoy the challenge with <strong>SIGame</strong>!</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-03-22", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-05-13T05:05:58", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/98d/98d3d6c5b87bfa1993a33a30ed20b115.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/da5/da542705acf147effd3fdb63dbd4b62d.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 5, "ratings": [{"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 4, "percent": 80.0}, {"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 1, "percent": 20.0}], "reactions": {}, "added": 17, "added_by_status": {"yet": 4, "owned": 5, "beaten": 4, "dropped": 3, "playing": 1}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 6, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_log